{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i><strong>Deep Space Corridor</strong></i>, a classic horror game about finding anomalies, with an added touch of narrative elements. You'll play as a so-called &quot;investigator&quot; who wakes up on a mysterious space station, tasked with inspecting a designated area to determine if any abnormal phenomena exist within it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/store_page_background.png?t=1753783208\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you detect anomalies, exit through the red door at the end of the corridor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you deem the area normal, exit through the blue door at the end of the corridor.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may encounter strange sights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.poster.avif?t=1753783208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.webm?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.mp4?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may also come across deadly enemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.poster.avif?t=1753783208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.webm?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.mp4?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you might run into cute rabbits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.poster.avif?t=1753783208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.webm?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.mp4?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you make correct judgments repeatedly, the story behind the mysterious space station will gradually unfold. After making a certain number of consecutive judgments, you'll advance to the next depth of the game, uncovering more truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/248e0d6fc84bfd8252703315df4d231e.avif?t=1753783208\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once you've fully cleared the story, a full collection mode will become available, allowing you to revisit and collect all abnormal events. Each correct judgment of an anomaly will unlock a unique achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Deep Space Corridor</i> offers a short but slightly terrifying \u730e\u5947 (bizarre) experience (approximately 60 minutes).<br>The game draws inspiration from \u300a<i>P.T.\u300b</i>, \u300a<i>The Exit 8\u300b</i>, and \u300a<i>The Cabin Factory\u300b</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794750?t=1753783208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/1750f0e23bdfa3fe4e1069deaa1b30efe4b860dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753783208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/bebbc3703fdaf7fa7b369e3e385489c07d5d10fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753783208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/bebbc3703fdaf7fa7b369e3e385489c07d5d10fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753783208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3906210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i><strong>Deep Space Corridor</strong></i>, a classic horror game about finding anomalies, with an added touch of narrative elements. You'll play as a so-called &quot;investigator&quot; who wakes up on a mysterious space station, tasked with inspecting a designated area to determine if any abnormal phenomena exist within it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/store_page_background.png?t=1753783208\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you detect anomalies, exit through the red door at the end of the corridor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you deem the area normal, exit through the blue door at the end of the corridor.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may encounter strange sights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.poster.avif?t=1753783208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.webm?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.mp4?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may also come across deadly enemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.poster.avif?t=1753783208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.webm?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.mp4?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you might run into cute rabbits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.poster.avif?t=1753783208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.webm?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.mp4?t=1753783208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you make correct judgments repeatedly, the story behind the mysterious space station will gradually unfold. After making a certain number of consecutive judgments, you'll advance to the next depth of the game, uncovering more truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/extras/248e0d6fc84bfd8252703315df4d231e.avif?t=1753783208\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once you've fully cleared the story, a full collection mode will become available, allowing you to revisit and collect all abnormal events. Each correct judgment of an anomaly will unlock a unique achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Deep Space Corridor</i> offers a short but slightly terrifying \u730e\u5947 (bizarre) experience (approximately 60 minutes).<br>The game draws inspiration from \u300a<i>P.T.\u300b</i>, \u300a<i>The Exit 8\u300b</i>, and \u300a<i>The Cabin Factory\u300b</i>.</p>","developers":["Night Watcher Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794750/9294a51af45d7252016e2eec41fc92f3c9cb6d8b/header.jpg?t=1753783208","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171705,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171705/movie480.mp4?t=1753783205","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171705/movie_max.mp4?t=1753783205"},"name":"SH","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171705/7169973afb128ded09dc350fb955adf7b78f3e2c/movie_600x337